# Redirects for old URLs that no longer have a page. The Pages workflow
# (.github/workflows/pages.yml) turns each rule into a small redirect page:
#   /old-path    /new-path  301
# A rule must never name a page that exists, or its redirect page would replace it.
# /onsite, /aside and /spotlight are real pages again (Other Projects, 2026-11-17).
